  "description": "<p>Rothco's Vintage B-15A Bomber Jacket pays homage to the iconic American flight jacket with its authentic design. The warm quilted lining features a vintage inspired Air Command print, while the removable fur collar adds extra warmth and comfort. Ribbed knit waist and cuff accents provide flexibility, and the military jacket boasts ample storage with 2 front pockets with snap closures and a sleeve zippered pocket. Small leather accents on the chest enhance the jacket's authenticity, and the bi-swing back ensures comfort and a greater range of motion. Made from durable heavyweight cotton, this military style jacket is ideal for spring, fall, and mild winters, offering timeless style and functionality.</p>",
